---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="FAIR — Federated and Independent Repositories"
  description="FAIR is a Linux Foundation project building an open ecosystem of federated, independent package repositories for WordPress and beyond."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-dark-blue leading-tight">
      FAIR — Federated and Independent Repositories
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-xl text-dark-gray leading-relaxed">
      FAIR is a Linux Foundation project creating an open, community-governed
      ecosystem of federated package repositories. Our mission is to ensure that
      WordPress plugin and theme distribution remains independent, transparent,
      and accessible to everyone.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-dark-gray leading-relaxed">
      By building shared infrastructure and open standards, FAIR empowers
      developers and repository operators to collaborate on a decentralized
      network — free from single points of control.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/about/"
      class="mt-8 inline-block text-lg font-semibold text-green hover:underline"
    >
      Learn more about FAIR →
    </a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
